# Vendored skill trees are third-party docs, not this repo's code. Indexing
# them inflates embedding time and lets vendored content outrank our own code
# in codebase_search. skills/ is NOT excluded wholesale — it holds the
# first-party `brainstorming` skill; its vendored entries are symlinks into
# the already-excluded skills-vendor/.
